{"resourceIdentifier":"2728","resourceName":"Huaibin MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Huaibin MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located in Zhengying Village, Wangjiagang Town, Huaibin County, Xinyang City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is invested, constructed and operated by Huaibin BCCY New Power Co., Ltd.. The objective is to collect the landfill gas (LFG) from Huaibin MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Huaibin landfill site) and utilize it to generate electricity.\r\nHuaibin landfill site is located in Zhengying Village, Wangjiagang Town, Huaibin County, Xinyang City, and started operation in 2008 with a total design effective capacity of 2,580,000 m3 and a municipal solid waste (MSW) disposal of 350 tons/d and an operational lifespan of 19 years. The project has a total designed capacity 2MW (4*500kW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). The project started construction on 25/10/2019 and started operation on 01/04/2020. The operation period of the project will end in 2030.\r\nThe project collects and utilizes LFG from Huaibin landfill site for power generation, which would otherwise be released into the atmosphere. Methane in the LFG has been emitted to the atmosphere since the landfill started operation. Therefore the project avoids methane emissions and, at the same time, electricity is generated from a renewable energy source, instead of being provided by the grid. \r\nScenario existing prior to the start of the implementation of the project activity (the same as baseline scenario) \r\n•\tLFG from Huaibin landfill site is released into the atmosphere.\r\n•\tEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the CCPG, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.   \r\nProject scenario\r\n•\tLFG from Huaibin landfill site is partially used for electricity generation. \r\n•\t4×500 kW LFG-generator sets  supply electricity to the CCPG.\t\r\nThe total power generation during the operation period is estimated to be 128,835 MWh. The estimated annual average emission reduction generated by the project over the crediting period is 59,196 tCO2e per year by avoiding the CH4 emissions from the landfill and the CO2 emissions from the fossil fuel power plants in the CCPG.","location":{"latitude":32.486387,"longitude":115.432777},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-12-08","endExclusive":"2022-01-08","endInclusive":"2022-01-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2728"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2728"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59196"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"08/07/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/04/2020 - 31/03/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=58551&IDKEY=jiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3380741829","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Huaibin_v2.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-07T21:16:13.847Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57758&IDKEY=n8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0q79648282","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation-Huaibin.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-11-12T01:56:04.53Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=60339&IDKEY=kq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh983207481","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS-Registration-Representation-Huaibin.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-24T06:10:00.683Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69520&IDKEY=j8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0j95868080","documentType":"Validation Report","documentName":"VCS-Validation-Report-Huaibin Clean 0627.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-07-08T04:53:58.04Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=60334&IDKEY=998klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8ds83200586","documentType":"Validation Representation","documentName":"VCS-Validation-Representation-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-24T05:59:41.223Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=74267&IDKEY=898klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d0102414193","documentType":"Issuance Representation","documentName":"Huaibin-VCS Issuance Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-09-21T00:39:51.077Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=121144&IDKEY=fq934lkms